      "raw": "<p>I unabashedly love the game shows. :D Though Christopher getting an answer wrong? D: My illusions are shattered. I'm so disappointed. I mean, if he doesn't have every card memorized, why the heck did I do it? What can you expect from someone who likes black licorice. :/</p>\r\n\r\n<p>I am however pleased that Citizens Peanut, Butter and Jelly are finally canon. :3 Good things come to those who wait!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also, if there's a Citizen Double whose power is just to have a single clone of themselves, then the team could actually be Double, Double, Toil and Trouble.</p>",
